WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.140
Wukong's cube floated through the stadium as the Battle Master spoke.

2
00:00:04.141 --> 00:00:06.760
"The next fighter doesn't look tough.

3
00:00:06.761 --> 00:00:12.149
But he likes to brag that he once defeated Heaven's entire army.

4
00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.658
I'm pleased to present . . . Sun Wukong!"

5
00:00:17.659 --> 00:00:21.148
The audience cheered.

6
00:00:21.149 --> 00:00:26.691
Then the cubes vanished. Wukong faced his opponent, Glytar.

7
00:00:26.692 --> 00:00:31.204
A blue alien in the audience pointed. "It's a cute little monkey!"

8
00:00:31.205 --> 00:00:33.664
The audience erupted into laughter.

9
00:00:33.665 --> 00:00:35.767
Wukong glared at the crowd.

10
00:00:35.768 --> 00:00:41.409
Then he turned to Glytar, who was leaning on his ax and laughing.

11
00:00:41.410 --> 00:00:43.503
"What's so funny?"

12
00:00:43.504 --> 00:00:47.324
Glytar shrugged. "You're tiny."

13
00:00:47.325 --> 00:00:50.787
"That's true. I am small," Wukong said.

14
00:00:50.788 --> 00:00:54.220
"Maybe you should fight someone your own size."

15
00:00:54.221 --> 00:00:57.900
"Maybe." Glytar picked up his ax.

16
00:00:57.901 --> 00:01:01.398
"But you're the only one here right now."

17
00:01:01.399 --> 00:01:08.317
Wukong smiled. "I still think you should fight someone your own size. So . . ."

18
00:01:08.318 --> 00:01:10.470
He quickly grew big.

19
00:01:10.471 --> 00:01:13.715
"Whoa!" Glytar stepped back.

20
00:01:13.716 --> 00:01:17.740
Wukong swung his iron bar. Glytar jumped to avoid it.

21
00:01:17.741 --> 00:01:19.407
Wukong swung again.

22
00:01:19.408 --> 00:01:23.052
His bar came down fast, but Glytar rolled out of the way.

23
00:01:23.053 --> 00:01:26.326
Wham! The bar slammed into the ground.

24
00:01:26.327 --> 00:01:30.627
Slice! Wukong felt Glytar's ax brush over his head.

25
00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:33.188
Several of his hairs fell to the ground.

26
00:01:33.189 --> 00:01:37.785
"Hey!" Wukong yelled. "I didn't ask for a haircut!"

27
00:01:37.786 --> 00:01:41.182
Glytar twirled his ax. "Ha-ha!"

28
00:01:41.183 --> 00:01:45.106
Wukong picked up the hairs and recited a spell.

29
00:01:45.107 --> 00:01:48.666
Glytar lowered his ax. "What are you doing?"

30
00:01:48.667 --> 00:01:51.900
"A trick I learned a long time ago."

31
00:01:51.901 --> 00:01:55.367
Suddenly three small Wukongs charged toward Glytar.

32
00:01:55.368 --> 00:01:58.984
"Ahh!" The alien swung his ax wildly.

33
00:01:58.985 --> 00:02:01.527
The Wukongs punched and kicked.

34
00:02:01.528 --> 00:02:04.298
Glytar's ax hit one of them. Poof!

35
00:02:04.299 --> 00:02:10.574
That Wukong disappeared, but another Wukong yanked the ax from Glytar's hands.

36
00:02:10.575 --> 00:02:14.507
"Yikes!" Glytar ducked as the Wukong swung.

37
00:02:14.508 --> 00:02:17.759
Then he grabbed the ax and shook off the little Wukong.

38
00:02:17.760 --> 00:02:20.542
He brought the ax down hard. Poof!

39
00:02:20.543 --> 00:02:22.728
The little Wukong vanished.

40
00:02:22.729 --> 00:02:25.465
Glytar stomped toward the third Wukong.

41
00:02:25.466 --> 00:02:28.826
Pow! Wukong swung his iron bar.

42
00:02:28.827 --> 00:02:32.822
Glytar flew into the crowd, crashing into the blue alien.

43
00:02:32.823 --> 00:02:37.441
The alien's drink spilled everywhere. "Oh man!"

44
00:02:37.442 --> 00:02:39.882
Wukong laughed.

45
00:02:39.883 --> 00:02:44.501
Glytar climbed to his feet. "I surrender!"

46
00:02:44.502 --> 00:02:49.278
"Sun Wukong wins!" the Battle Master said.

47
00:02:49.279 --> 00:02:51.729
The crowd cheered as Wukong took a bow.

48
00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:55.346
His cube reappeared and brought him back to the other cubes.

49
00:02:55.347 --> 00:02:57.900
"That was fun," Wukong thought.

50
00:02:57.901 --> 00:03:02.366
"But I really do need to get out of here. The Tang Monk needs—"

51
00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:04.695
"Wukong!" someone shouted.

52
00:03:04.696 --> 00:03:06.611
Wukong looked down.

53
00:03:06.612 --> 00:03:09.598
Rocket Girl and Kid Comet were in cubes below him.

54
00:03:09.599 --> 00:03:12.777
He gasped. "What are you two doing here?"

55
00:03:12.778 --> 00:03:16.015
Cozlin shrugged. "The same thing you're doing.

56
00:03:16.016 --> 00:03:19.223
The Battle Master captured us to make us fight."

57
00:03:19.224 --> 00:03:22.113
"We need to escape!" Roxy said.

58
00:03:22.114 --> 00:03:24.456
The Battle Master's voice boomed again.

59
00:03:24.457 --> 00:03:28.960
"Our next fighter comes from the planet Zentaria.

60
00:03:28.961 --> 00:03:34.932
Give a warm welcome to Nebulon!"

61
00:03:34.933 --> 00:03:38.177
A cube carried a warrior who was doing stretches.

62
00:03:38.178 --> 00:03:40.890
A sword and shield lay on the floor.

63
00:03:40.891 --> 00:03:45.420
Wukong laughed. "That guy's a joke!

64
00:03:45.421 --> 00:03:47.429
You two don't need to worry.

65
00:03:47.430 --> 00:03:50.955
I'll defeat everyone here, and then the three of us will leave."

66
00:03:50.956 --> 00:03:54.811
"We have bigger opponents to worry about," Roxy said.

67
00:03:54.812 --> 00:03:57.591
"Like who?" Wukong asked.

68
00:03:57.592 --> 00:03:59.981
Roxy pointed. "That!"

69
00:03:59.982 --> 00:04:02.028
Another cube floated out.

70
00:04:02.029 --> 00:04:04.225
It was much bigger than the others.

71
00:04:04.226 --> 00:04:07.104
A blast of flames filled it with smoke.

72
00:04:07.105 --> 00:04:13.937
When the smoke cleared, Wukong saw a large dragon inside!

